Document
  MarkdownBlock
    Section
      Paragraph
        Line
          Text "Markdown began as a way to write for the web without writing HTML. It was never"
        Line
          Text "given a grammar, only a description and a script, and every tool since has had"
        Line
          Text "to decide for itself what the description meant."
      Paragraph
        Line
          Text "That is "
          Emphasis
            Text "why"
          Text " two tools can disagree about the same file. One reads an indented"
        Line
          Text "line as code; another reads it as the end of a list. Neither is wrong, because"
        Line
          Text "nothing says which is right."
      BlockQuote "A format with no grammar is a format with as many grammars as it has readers."
      Paragraph
        Line
          Text "The rest of this essay is about living with that."
